flowchart TD
    Input[Input role, type, useResume, resume] --> Normalize[Trim and lowercase type]
    Normalize --> NonEmpty{Nonempty string?}
    NonEmpty -->|No| Throw[Throw validation error]
    NonEmpty -->|Yes| Choose{type is hr?}
    Choose -->|Yes| HRPrompt[Build HR prompt]
    Choose -->|No| TechPrompt[Build technical prompt]
    HRPrompt --> LLM[ChatGroq llm.invoke]
    TechPrompt --> LLM
    LLM --> Content[response.content]
    Content --> Clean[Remove fenced JSON markers]
    Clean --> Parse{JSON.parse}
    Parse -->|OK| Questions[Return question JSON]
    Parse -->|Error| Catch[Log and rethrow]
